Implementation cannot safely start from this specification. The author's "full coverage" claim is false.

**What would let wrong behaviour through:**
- **Gold at 8400:** the feature and the outer test both say 8400, but AC-3 says 8500 (15%). Implementing to the test would ship a 16% Gold discount.
- **AC-4 is missing:** the rounding-in-the-customer's-favour rule has no scenario. Every example uses 10000 cents, so truncating, rounding half up or banker's rounding would all pass.

The outer test also does not compile, so it never fails on a business assertion. The review is saved at `.copilot-tracking/skraft-plans/pricing/reviews/2026-10-18/distill-review-1.md`.
